WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.401
A

00:00:00.533 --> 00:00:04.270 size:53% position:73% line:50%
COUPLE OF DAYS.

00:00:02.769 --> 00:00:05.538 size:53% position:73% line:50%
WE'VE GOT TO GET TO GIANNIS,

00:00:04.404 --> 00:00:05.905 size:53% position:73% line:50%
LIVE AT THE PODIUM ADDRESSING

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:08.241 size:53% position:73% line:50%
THE MEDIA.

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:08.575 size:53% position:73% line:50%
HE HAD EIGHT ASSISTS AND THREE

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:13.179 size:53% position:73% line:50%
STEALS.

00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:13.813 size:53% position:73% line:50%
&gt;&gt; CAN YOU SEND ME THROUGH THE

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:18.551 size:53% position:73% line:50%
BLOCK?

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:25.725 size:53% position:73% line:50%
GIANNIS: JUST HUSTLE PLAY.

00:00:22.155 --> 00:00:27.093 size:53% position:73% line:50%
GOING DOWN THE STRETCH, JUST

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:28.395 size:53% position:73% line:50%
DOING WHATEVER IT TAKES TO WIN

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:29.963 size:53% position:73% line:50%
THE GAME, JUST PUT YOURSELF IN

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:33.566 size:53% position:73% line:50%
THE POSITION THAT CAN BE THE

00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:37.937 size:53% position:73% line:50%
GAME.

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:42.175 size:53% position:73% line:50%
I SAW THE PLAY COMING.

00:00:40.273 --> 00:00:45.678 size:53% position:73% line:50%
I AM JUST GOING TO JUMP

00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:47.147 size:53% position:73% line:50%
VERTICALLY TOWARDS THE RIM.

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:47.447 size:53% position:73% line:50%
HOPEFULLY I CAN BE THERE IN

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:50.283 size:53% position:73% line:50%
TIME.

00:00:48.782 --> 00:00:52.685 size:53% position:73% line:50%
I WAS THERE IN TIME AND WAS ABLE

00:00:50.417 --> 00:00:54.254 size:53% position:73% line:50%
TO GET A GOOD BLOCK AND GO DOWN

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:55.188 size:53% position:73% line:50%
AND GET TWO POINTS.

00:00:54.387 --> 00:01:00.093 size:53% position:73% line:50%
IT WAS A GREAT HUSTLE PLAY.

00:00:57.557 --> 00:01:00.794 size:53% position:73% line:50%
&gt;&gt; IT FELT LIKE A STRANGE ANGLE,

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:01.861 size:53% position:73% line:50%
LIKE IT WAS ONE OF THOSE SPOTS

00:01:00.927 --> 00:01:02.629 size:53% position:73% line:50%
WHERE THE TOSS CAME OUT OF

00:01:02.295 --> 00:01:05.565 size:53% position:73% line:50%
NOWHERE.

00:01:03.897 --> 00:01:08.334 size:53% position:73% line:50%
DID IT SURPRISE YOU AT ALL?

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:11.104 size:53% position:73% line:50%
GIANNIS: IT DID NOT SURPRISE ME.

00:01:09.068 --> 00:01:12.705 size:53% position:73% line:50%
I SAW IT COMING.

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:14.707 size:53% position:73% line:50%
ONCE I SAW HIM PUT IN HIS ONE

00:01:13.206 --> 00:01:15.642 size:53% position:73% line:50%
HAND, HE WAS TOO FAR FROM A

00:01:14.841 --> 00:01:16.543 size:53% position:73% line:50%
LAYUP, SO I KNEW HE WAS TRYING

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:20.346 size:53% position:73% line:50%
TO LOB ME.

00:01:19.879 --> 00:01:23.383 size:53% position:73% line:50%
I HAD COMMITTED SO MUCH.

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:26.219 size:53% position:73% line:50%
I FELT HIM ROLLING IN BEHIND ME.

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:29.389 size:53% position:73% line:50%
I KNEW THE ONLY CHANCE TO GET A

00:01:26.352 --> 00:01:34.627 size:53% position:73% line:50%
STOP WAS TO JUST JUMP TOWARDS

00:01:29.856 --> 00:01:35.228 size:53% position:73% line:50%
THE RIM AND TRY TO COVER THAT

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:41.734 size:53% position:73% line:50%
ANGLE FOR HIM TO SCORE.

00:01:41.134 --> 00:01:42.836 size:53% position:73% line:50%
&gt;&gt; HE THOUGHT AS HE WAS

00:01:41.868 --> 00:01:43.570 size:53% position:73% line:50%
GOING TO JUMP UP, HE WAS GOING

00:01:42.969 --> 00:01:46.873 size:53% position:73% line:50%
TO DUNK IT?

00:01:45.572 --> 00:01:48.107 size:53% position:73% line:50%
&gt;&gt; I WAS LATE.

00:01:47.006 --> 00:01:49.909 size:53% position:73% line:50%
IF I WERE ON THE OPPOSITE SIDE,

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:52.078 size:53% position:73% line:50%
IT IS A DUNK.

00:01:50.176 --> 00:01:53.012 size:53% position:73% line:50%
BUT AS I SAID, I DID NOT JUMP TO

00:01:52.212 --> 00:01:55.515 size:53% position:73% line:50%
BLOCK THE BALL, I JUMPED TOWARDS

00:01:54.647 --> 00:01:56.449 size:53% position:73% line:50%
THE RIM.

00:01:55.648 --> 00:02:00.320 size:53% position:73% line:50%
I FELT LIKE THAT'S WHAT KIND OF

00:01:56.583 --> 00:02:00.954 size:53% position:73% line:50%
HELPED ME, PUT ME IT IN A

00:02:00.453 --> 00:02:05.458 size:53% position:73% line:50%
POSITION TO GET THE BLOCK.

00:02:03.056 --> 00:02:07.060 size:53% position:73% line:50%
THE RIM WAS RIGHT HERE SO I

00:02:05.592 --> 00:02:08.862 size:53% position:73% line:50%
JUMPED RIGHT HERE SO HE COULD

00:02:07.193 --> 00:02:10.663 size:53% position:73% line:50%
SHOOT THE BALL -- IF HE SHOT THE

00:02:08.995 --> 00:02:11.364 size:53% position:73% line:50%
BALL THROUGH THE BACKBOARD, IT

00:02:10.797 --> 00:02:11.364 size:53% position:73% line:50%
WOULD PROBABLY BE GOALTENDING,

